before:
Complete local C++ example; the app itself does not execute it:
```cpp
#include <iostream>
int sum_down(int n)
{
    if (n <= 0) { return 0; }
    return n + sum_down(n - 1);
}

int main()
{
    std::cout << sum_down(3) << "\n";
}

```

